Package: tind-extras
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: apt, curl, gnupg, ca-certificates, debconf, libnotify-bin
Installed-Size: 4
Description: Tind optional stacks: games and developer tools
 Scripts that add the gaming stack (Steam, Lutris, Wine, 32-bit graphics
 libraries, all from Debian packages) and the developer base set (git,
 compilers, Python tools, GitHub CLI, VS Code from Microsoft's apt
 repository). They run from the installer's tick boxes on first boot, or
 later from Tind Apps. Nothing here is on the ISO; all of it needs internet.
